---
source: tests/help.rs
expression: help(&path)
---
Register MCP servers for sandboxes

Usage: sbt mcp [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  add      Register an MCP server
  ls       List registered MCP servers [alias: list]
  inspect  Show a registered MCP server
  rm       Remove a registered MCP server [alias: remove]
  auth     Authorize OAuth servers (not supported: smolbento has no MCP gateway)
  load     Attach a server to a running sandbox (not supported: smolbento has no MCP gateway)
  unload   Detach a server from a running sandbox (not supported: smolbento has no MCP gateway)
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -D, --debug
          Print each smolvm command line

  -h, --help
          Print help
